message: "If you use this software or the frozen results, please cite the paper."
title: "Causal DAG Identification for Count Data via Poisson-Thinning Structural Equation Models"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the PT-SEM paper: the numerical cores, the locked
  simulation designs, the committed results of all three experiment lines, and
  the programs that draw every figure and table the manuscript reports.
